text = "[b][font_size=19]Scale gallery[/font_size][/b]\n[color=#93a1b5]Every IScale on hand-built charts; BandScale and RadialScale have no built-in consumer, so the two custom marks here provide one. Marks: ChartCustomizationDemo; canvas: ChartCanvasDemo.[/color]"
